cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "A scalable algorithm for SIC-POVMs"
abstract: >-
  Software and data for Weyl–Heisenberg covariant symmetric informationally complete
  positive operator-valued measures (SIC-POVMs) in power-of-two dimensions: exact construction
  of Galois multiplets of fiducial vectors, certified evaluation and verification, and the
  fiducial vectors in the dimensions 2 to 2048 as floating-point and exact data.
authors:
  - family-names: "Yamasaki"
    given-names: "Hayata"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-28"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Hayata-Yamasaki-Group/sic-povm"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - "SIC-POVM"
  - "Weyl–Heisenberg group"
  - "equiangular lines"
  - "fiducial vectors"
  - "exact computation"
  - "certified numerics"
